index 1644e31..e49c37a 100644
--- a/GLOSSARY.md
+++ b/GLOSSARY.md
@@ -27,10 +27,17 @@ One execution of a Job.
 A Run has a stable id and one terminal outcome:
 
 - succeeded;
-- failed.
+- failed;
+- cancelled.
 
 A Run may contain one or more Attempts.
 
+A running Run can be cancelled, including before its first Attempt. A cancelled
+Run accepts no further Attempts. Repeating cancellation succeeds without changing
+the Run. Cancelling a succeeded or failed Run is a conflict and preserves its
+outcome. Cancellation emits no Alert and appears as the Job's latest terminal
+Last result on the Dashboard. Existing Attempts and Alerts remain available.
+
 ## Attempt
 
 One try within a Run.
